    {
      "parameters": {
        "description": "=Search the PoultryMall Knowledge Base for trusted poultry information.\n\nUse this tool ONLY when the user asks about:\n\n• Poultry farming\n• Broiler farming\n• Layer farming\n• Feed management\n• Feed Conversion Ratio (FCR)\n• Vaccination schedules\n• Bird diseases\n• Biosecurity\n• Poultry housing and equipment\n• Poultry business guidance\n• Market insights and trends\n• Why egg prices increase or decrease\n• How egg prices are calculated or updated\n• Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\n• Company information\n• Shipping and support\n\nDo NOT use this tool for:\n• Today's egg price\n• Current/live egg rate\n• Egg price in a specific city\n• Market prices for today\n\nAlways search the knowledge base before answering.\n\nInput should be the user's complete question.\n\nIf no relevant information is found, reply:\n\"I couldn't find that information in the PoultryMall knowledge base.\"\n\nNever make up information that is not present in the retrieved documents.",
